# This project uses two separate .env files:
#   server/.env  -> see server/.env.example for backend variables (Mongo URI, JWT secret, Stripe key, etc.)
#   client/.env  -> see client/.env.example for frontend variables (API base URL)
#
# Copy each example file and fill in your own values:
#   cp server/.env.example server/.env
#   cp client/.env.example client/.env
